WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.167
-Now, I thought I'd share

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.769
some of my favorite #WhyIQuit
stories from you guys.

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:06.573
This first one's
from @soupymcsoupface.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.608
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.976 --> 00:00:12.278
He says...

00:00:17.549 --> 00:00:19.018
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:20.453
Right? Okay, Brain?

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.689
-Nope.
Now I'm Soupy McSoupface.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.224
-Yeah.

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:25.391
-I'll show -- I'll show him!

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:26.559
-I'll show him, yeah.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:30.195
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.195 --> 00:00:31.264
"You call me Brain, man?"

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:32.298
-"You can't call me Brain
at all, man."

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.134
-"Call me Soupy McSoupface."

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:38.037
This one is from @toshoonly.

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.706
-Toshoonly.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.707
-"To," like t-o.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.542
-Like "too shoon"?

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:43.743
-Toshoon.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.378
-It's been too shoon.
-Too shoon. Too soon.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.646
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:49.082
Toshoonly.
She says...

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:55.621
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:56.989
-What?!

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:58.424
-Giddy-up! Giddy-up!

00:00:58.424 --> 00:00:59.725
Let's go! Come on!
-Come on, Brain!

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:00.760
[ Percussion
imitating hoofbeats ]

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.830
-What in the world?
"Come on, Brain!"

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.765
-"Don't be slippin'
on that wet floor!

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.100
<i> Piso mojado!"</i>

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.135
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:16.809
-This one's from @brennancarrow.

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:17.877
She says...

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:26.419
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:27.420
You're next.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.088
-[ Deep voice ]
You're next.

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:31.791
[ Gravelly voice ] Redrum,
Mrs. Torrance.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.226
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:35.461
This one's from @kschmooze.

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:37.663
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:39.398
That's her real last name.
-Yeah, that's her last name.

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:41.200
-Yeah, Schmooze.
-Kathryn Schmooze.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.402
-Kathryn Schmooze.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.537
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:46.072
She says...

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:51.845
-Oh!
-Come on, man.

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:53.746
-That's not good.
-What? Come on, dude.

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.115
-Come on, man.

00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:00.185
-This one's from
@johnathanyoung.

00:02:00.185 --> 00:02:01.521
He said...

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.560
-Come on.
That's entrapment!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.362
-Come on, that's catch-22.

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.531
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:12.765
Hey, Brain, you got a knife?

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.067
-Yeah, yeah, Brain.

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:19.105
This one's from @yzracer81.
He says...

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:29.048
I don't -- I don't know.

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.283
-That wasn't about work.

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:32.618
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:32.618 --> 00:02:34.787
I don't know, man.
-Yeah.

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:37.389
-This one is from
@captainharris1.

00:02:37.389 --> 00:02:38.525
He says...

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:47.399
This place gets robbed?

00:02:47.399 --> 00:02:49.669
-A lot.
-I'm getting out of here.

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.037
[ Applause ]

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:54.040
Last one's from @verambassi.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.275
She says...

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.249
I'm taking off.
There you have it.

